  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat. Add onion, carrots, and celery, cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add garlic, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add veal shanks, cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add red wine, beef broth, tomato paste, bay leaves, and Peppadew peppers. Bring to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
